From 4d28c9d273822d89bfc30868c7a71b6899594de8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akash Srivastava <akashniki@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:11:57 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] ishtar: add ishtarPkg (Xiaomi 13 Ultra, SM8550-AB)

Board package for ishtar on uefi-sheng: platform DSC/FDF, includes,
MemoryMapLib and ConfigurationMapLib derived from shengPkg, and ishtar's own
board drivers (IshtarKeyInputDxe, IshtarBootMemoryDxe, IshtarGopLogDxe,
IshtarDisplayDepexDxe; from sheng's, new FILE_GUIDs). ISHTAR_VENDOR_HW = 0:
Mu drivers and SimpleFbDxe on the XBL-lit 1440x3200 panel. Vendor binaries
come from Binaries/ishtar, extracted from ishtar's stock HyperOS uefi image.
Second DRAM bank entries for the 12 GB layout. Boot image config from nuwa
(header v1).
